{"parentUuid":"c6756675-5f1c-4c82-8876-5c88dd90fadb","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ac07b073c0dacf54f","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cg22Q14aFMXCXHSJkzWjn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ec2qHywp4vFEcKgiVkgk2o","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"multiecuscan.net Giulia 2.0 modules list adjustments coding"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1777,"cache_read_input_tokens":138992,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1777,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Ec2qHywp4vFEcKgiVkgk2o":{"query":"multiecuscan.net Giulia 2.0 modules list adjustments coding"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"1f82993c-1f16-4d99-95ad-31b7f8ecf680","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cg22Pzox32xbajoy2vCsq","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"599c1d3d-51c0-42c0-ad5b-9c42070b6a50","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:08:51.267Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"c6756675-5f1c-4c82-8876-5c88dd90fadb","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"40b7f807-a415-4409-a892-240554e919cf","agentId":"ac07b073c0dacf54f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QXCeH6RVDgDoSZP7YjqATZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"multiecuscan.net Alfa Romeo Stelvio supported functions parameters actuators\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"New MultiEcuScan 4.6\",\"url\":\"https://www.alfaowner.com/threads/new-multiecuscan-4-6.1190364/\"},{\"title\":\"Multiecuscan Diagnostic SOFTWARE For Alfa Romeo\",\"url\":\"https://shop.alfissimo.com/diagnostic-softwarehardware-multiecuscanalfaobd/1600-multiecuscan-diagnostic-software-for-alfa-romeo.html\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Stelvio F6 Actuators Turbo Vacuum Valve - Multiecuscan\",\"url\":\"http://forum.multiecuscan.net/viewtopic.php?t=9514\"},{\"title\":\"Multiecuscan SOFTWARE- Alfa Romeo\",\"url\":\"https://shop.alfissimo.com/diagnostic-software-multiecuscanalfaobd/1600-software-only-in-conjunction-with-hardware-purchase-1-license-for-multiecuscan-full-version-1-year-update.html\"},{\"title\":\"Multiecuscan - App Store - Apple\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/multiecuscan/id1436939705\"},{\"title\":\"New 5.1 version MES (MultiEcuScan) out\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/new-5-1-version-mes-multiecuscan-out.18205/\"},{\"title\":\"Is Multiecuscan for Alfa Romeo the Right Diagnostic Tool for Your Car?\",\"url\":\"https://www.aliexpress.com/s/wiki-ssr/article/multiecuscan-alfa-romeo\"},{\"title\":\"MultiEcuScan Download - Diagnose und Elektronik - Alfa Romeo Portal - Community und Forum für Alfisti - Fachforum Reparatur Werkstatt Anleitungen Technik Hilfe Tuning Beratung Verkauf Teile Ersatzteile Treffen ItaloEcu\",\"url\":\"https://www.alfa-romeo-portal.com/forum/thread/979-multiecuscan-download/\"},{\"title\":\"MultiECUscan Use, Tips and Issues\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-use-tips-and-issues.40594/page-3\"},{\"title\":\"Multiecuscan Help\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/multiecuscan-help.19957/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about MultiEcuScan for Alfa Romeo Stelvio:\n\n## Supported Functions\n\nMultiEcuScan is compatible with ELM327 / CAN327 interfaces (minimum V1.3), FIAT-KKL Interface, OBDProtect Interface, OBDKey Interface, Bluetooth interface CAN327, OBDLink interface, and ELM327 and CAN327 WIFI interface.\n\nThe functionality includes: Fault code reading and clearing, Live sensor data, Live data graphical view, Actuator testing, Reset/programming functions, PROXI configuration, Service Reminder reset, and Generic EOBD vehicle diagnostics.\n\n## Parameters and Capabilities\n\nThe registered version supports unlimited simultaneous parameter selection, actuator tests with parameter monitoring while executing an actuator test, and reset/programming functions.\n\nMultiEcuScan supports live data streaming from sensors not accessible via standard tools such as throttle position calibration values, fuel trim adjustments per cylinder, and turbo boost pressure readings from the MAP sensor in turbocharged engines.\n\n## Stelvio-Specific Modules and Actuators\n\nSupport includes Magna Q4 Transfer Case (Giulia, Stelvio), Steering Lock TRW (Giulia, Stelvio), Haptical lane feedback (HALF) camera Bosch (Giulia, Stelvio), Driver assistant system module (DASM) radar Bosch (Giulia, Stelvio), Engine sound enhancement module (ESEM) (Giulia, Stelvio), and Torque vectoring module (TVM) (Giulia, Stelvio).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"008990bb-f47d-4b6d-9d0a-50aca32d37a6","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:08:58.504Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"multiecuscan.net Alfa Romeo Stelvio supported functions parameters actuators","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01HUVv4Pw4bMbmg1Jfw41wfi","content":[{"title":"New MultiEcuScan 4.6","url":"https://www.alfaowner.com/threads/new-multiecuscan-4-6.1190364/"},{"title":"Multiecuscan Diagnostic SOFTWARE For Alfa Romeo","url":"https://shop.alfissimo.com/diagnostic-softwarehardware-multiecuscanalfaobd/1600-multiecuscan-diagnostic-software-for-alfa-romeo.html"},{"title":"Alfa Stelvio F6 Actuators Turbo Vacuum Valve - Multiecuscan","url":"http://forum.multiecuscan.net/viewtopic.php?t=9514"},{"title":"Multiecuscan SOFTWARE- Alfa Romeo","url":"https://shop.alfissimo.com/diagnostic-software-multiecuscanalfaobd/1600-software-only-in-conjunction-with-hardware-purchase-1-license-for-multiecuscan-full-version-1-year-update.html"},{"title":"Multiecuscan - App Store - Apple","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/multiecuscan/id1436939705"},{"title":"New 5.1 version MES (MultiEcuScan) out","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/new-5-1-version-mes-multiecuscan-out.18205/"},{"title":"Is Multiecuscan for Alfa Romeo the Right Diagnostic Tool for Your Car?","url":"https://www.aliexpress.com/s/wiki-ssr/article/multiecuscan-alfa-romeo"},{"title":"MultiEcuScan Download - Diagnose und Elektronik - Alfa Romeo Portal - Community und Forum für Alfisti - Fachforum Reparatur Werkstatt Anleitungen Technik Hilfe Tuning Beratung Verkauf Teile Ersatzteile Treffen ItaloEcu","url":"https://www.alfa-romeo-portal.com/forum/thread/979-multiecuscan-download/"},{"title":"MultiECUscan Use, Tips and Issues","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-use-tips-and-issues.40594/page-3"},{"title":"Multiecuscan Help","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/multiecuscan-help.19957/"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about MultiEcuScan for Alfa Romeo Stelvio:\n\n## Supported Functions\n\nMultiEcuScan is compatible with ELM327 / CAN327 interfaces (minimum V1.3), FIAT-KKL Interface, OBDProtect Interface, OBDKey Interface, Bluetooth interface CAN327, OBDLink interface, and ELM327 and CAN327 WIFI interface.\n\nThe functionality includes: Fault code reading and clearing, Live sensor data, Live data graphical view, Actuator testing, Reset/programming functions, PROXI configuration, Service Reminder reset, and Generic EOBD vehicle diagnostics.\n\n## Parameters and Capabilities\n\nThe registered version supports unlimited simultaneous parameter selection, actuator tests with parameter monitoring while executing an actuator test, and reset/programming functions.\n\nMultiEcuScan supports live data streaming from sensors not accessible via standard tools such as throttle position calibration values, fuel trim adjustments per cylinder, and turbo boost pressure readings from the MAP sensor in turbocharged engines.\n\n## Stelvio-Specific Modules and Actuators\n\nSupport includes Magna Q4 Transfer Case (Giulia, Stelvio), Steering Lock TRW (Giulia, Stelvio), Haptical lane feedback (HALF) camera Bosch (Giulia, Stelvio), Driver assistant system module (DASM) radar Bosch (Giulia, Stelvio), Engine sound enhancement module (ESEM) (Giulia, Stelvio), and Torque vectoring module (TVM) (Giulia, Stelvio)."],"durationSeconds":7.502247799873352,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1f82993c-1f16-4d99-95ad-31b7f8ecf680","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c6756675-5f1c-4c82-8876-5c88dd90fadb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"599c1d3d-51c0-42c0-ad5b-9c42070b6a50","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"40b7f807-a415-4409-a892-240554e919cf","agentId":"ac07b073c0dacf54f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ec2qHywp4vFEcKgiVkgk2o","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"multiecuscan.net Giulia 2.0 modules list adjustments coding\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Difference in the list of Giulia modules... - Multiecuscan\",\"url\":\"http://forum.multiecuscan.net/viewtopic.php?t=8894\"},{\"title\":\"MultiEcuScan version 4.5 released\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-version-4-5-released.46634/\"},{\"title\":\"MultiECUscan Use, Tips and Issues\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-use-tips-and-issues.40594/page-3\"},{\"title\":\"Multiecuscan - Diagnostics software for Italian cars\",\"url\":\"https://multiecuscan.net/SupportedVehiclesList.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"New MES 4.2\",\"url\":\"https://www.alfaowner.com/Forum/alfa-giulia/1167523-new-mes-4-2-a.html\"},{\"title\":\"Giulia Non QV Race Mode - Multiecuscan\",\"url\":\"https://www.multiecuscan.net/forum/viewtopic.php?t=8112\"},{\"title\":\"MultiECUscan Use, Tips and Issues\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-use-tips-and-issues.40594/\"},{\"title\":\"error post retrofit radar my20 giulia on my17 - Multiecuscan\",\"url\":\"https://www.multiecuscan.net/forum/viewtopic.php?t=9586\"},{\"title\":\"Multiecuscan (MES) - Popular Settings Compilation - Electronics - Giulia Tech Community\",\"url\":\"https://giuliatech.com/t/multiecuscan-mes-popular-settings-compilation/80\"},{\"title\":\"Giulia Coding TVM, BCM, ETM Modules - Help - MHH AUTO - Page 1\",\"url\":\"https://mhhauto.com/Thread-Giulia-Coding-TVM-BCM-ETM-Modules-Help\"}]\n\nI found relevant information about multiecuscan.net and Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 modules. Here are the key findings:\n\n## Supported Modules for Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0\n\nThe Giulia includes various modules such as Driver Assistant System Node (DASM), Radio Frequency Hub Node (RFHM), Climate Control Node (HVAC/NCL), Entertainment Telematic Node (ETM), Comfort Seat and Wheel Node (CSWM), Entertainment multimedia control module (EMCM), Electric Steering Node (EPS/NGE), and Brake System Node (ABS/BSM/NFR).\n\n## Module List and Adjustments\n\nModules include the Body Computer (BCM/NBC), Gearbox Selector Module (ESM/GSM/NSC), ABS/Brake System Module (ABS/BSM), Driver Assistant System Module (DASM), and various other components.\n\n## Coding and Configuration\n\nFor Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V Multiair, users can access the Body → CAN Setup / PROXI ALIGNMENT PROCEDURE (952) → Adjustment tab, then hit Ctrl+Alt+C to alter raw PROXI data.\n\nThe process involves navigating to Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V Multiair → Body → CAN Setup / PROXI ALIGNMENT PROCEDURE (952) and clicking on the Adjustment tab to access PROXI bytes dialog.\n\nThe search results show that MultiEcuScan supports extensive module configuration and coding capabilities for the Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0, with regular updates adding new PROXI configuration options and adjustments.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"55643b04-498a-4c24-a7cc-40b9f789cf95","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:08:59.019Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"multiecuscan.net Giulia 2.0 modules list adjustments coding","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01N5BmYBwgFn1vdTjPXcXSBh","content":[{"title":"Difference in the list of Giulia modules... - Multiecuscan","url":"http://forum.multiecuscan.net/viewtopic.php?t=8894"},{"title":"MultiEcuScan version 4.5 released","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-version-4-5-released.46634/"},{"title":"MultiECUscan Use, Tips and Issues","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-use-tips-and-issues.40594/page-3"},{"title":"Multiecuscan - Diagnostics software for Italian cars","url":"https://multiecuscan.net/SupportedVehiclesList.aspx"},{"title":"New MES 4.2","url":"https://www.alfaowner.com/Forum/alfa-giulia/1167523-new-mes-4-2-a.html"},{"title":"Giulia Non QV Race Mode - Multiecuscan","url":"https://www.multiecuscan.net/forum/viewtopic.php?t=8112"},{"title":"MultiECUscan Use, Tips and Issues","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/multiecuscan-use-tips-and-issues.40594/"},{"title":"error post retrofit radar my20 giulia on my17 - Multiecuscan","url":"https://www.multiecuscan.net/forum/viewtopic.php?t=9586"},{"title":"Multiecuscan (MES) - Popular Settings Compilation - Electronics - Giulia Tech Community","url":"https://giuliatech.com/t/multiecuscan-mes-popular-settings-compilation/80"},{"title":"Giulia Coding TVM, BCM, ETM Modules - Help - MHH AUTO - Page 1","url":"https://mhhauto.com/Thread-Giulia-Coding-TVM-BCM-ETM-Modules-Help"}]},"I found relevant information about multiecuscan.net and Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 modules. Here are the key findings:\n\n## Supported Modules for Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0\n\nThe Giulia includes various modules such as Driver Assistant System Node (DASM), Radio Frequency Hub Node (RFHM), Climate Control Node (HVAC/NCL), Entertainment Telematic Node (ETM), Comfort Seat and Wheel Node (CSWM), Entertainment multimedia control module (EMCM), Electric Steering Node (EPS/NGE), and Brake System Node (ABS/BSM/NFR).\n\n## Module List and Adjustments\n\nModules include the Body Computer (BCM/NBC), Gearbox Selector Module (ESM/GSM/NSC), ABS/Brake System Module (ABS/BSM), Driver Assistant System Module (DASM), and various other components.\n\n## Coding and Configuration\n\nFor Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V Multiair, users can access the Body → CAN Setup / PROXI ALIGNMENT PROCEDURE (952) → Adjustment tab, then hit Ctrl+Alt+C to alter raw PROXI data.\n\nThe process involves navigating to Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V Multiair → Body → CAN Setup / PROXI ALIGNMENT PROCEDURE (952) and clicking on the Adjustment tab to access PROXI bytes dialog.\n\nThe search results show that MultiEcuScan supports extensive module configuration and coding capabilities for the Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0, with regular updates adding new PROXI configuration options and adjustments."],"durationSeconds":7.7386115000247955,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1f82993c-1f16-4d99-95ad-31b7f8ecf680","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"599c1d3d-51c0-42c0-ad5b-9c42070b6a50","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
